OL,3,GNEWSAPair bailed after security breach
OL,4,Aat RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Latvian men arrested after a fence
OL,7,Fwas breached at a Cambridgeshire RAF
OL,8,Fbase have been bailed.
OL,10,FMinistry of Defence Police (MDP)
OL,11,Fsecurity patrols at RAF Molesworth,
OL,12,Fwhich is used by the US military and
OL,13,FNato for intelligence operations,
OL,14,Fidentified an abandoned vehicle at
OL,15,Fabout 22:00 BST on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe pair, aged 36 and 32 and who live
OL,18,Fin the UK, were subsequently arrested
OL,19,Finside the perimeter a few hours after
OL,20,Fsearches found a small breach of the
OL,21,Ffence at the site.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
