OL,3,GNEWSAPair bailed after security breach
OL,4,Aat RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth were taken to a Cambridgeshire
OL,7,Fpolice station and have since been
OL,8,Fbailed with "strict conditions", the
OL,9,FMetropolitan Police said.
